# Real product data

Production UI must read real API/session/domain data. Never copy demo content from design PNGs.

No fake production routes, arrays, users, projects, conversations, counts, prices, usage or notification states.

Missing future features (Direct Chats, full Projects, @Vimla operator, Brain, Files, Images/Video, Agents, etc.) may appear only as dev/test presentation fixtures or behind genuine feature gates with no fake behavior.

Empty/loading/error/disabled states are preferred to pretending a missing backend exists.
